---
description: RS256 access-token and opaque refresh-token invariants.
globs: ["app/**/*Auth*.php", "app/**/Token*.php", "config/jwt.php", "tests/**/*Auth*.php"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Issue short-lived RS256 access tokens with validated issuer, audience, status, and token version. Persist only opaque refresh-token hashes; preserve atomic rotation, replay detection, family revocation, Redis locking, and revoke-all behavior.
